# INSPECTRA client - environment template
#
# Leave VITE_API_URL unset. The client calls "/api/v1" on its own origin and something
# forwards it to the API at both ends:
#
#   development  server.proxy in vite.config.ts
#   production   the /api rewrite in vercel.json
#
# That is deliberate, not incidental. Auth is an httpOnly cookie, and same-origin keeps
# it a first-party cookie: no CORS preflight, no SameSite=None, and nothing that browsers
# blocking third-party cookies will quietly break. Pointing VITE_API_URL straight at the
# API origin works but gives all three of those problems back.
#
# VITE_API_PROXY overrides the dev proxy target when you want a local server:
# VITE_API_PROXY=http://localhost:5000
